platform-power-manager (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Security: harden the systemd unit (PrivateTmp, RestrictAddressFamilies=AF_UNIX,
    RestrictNamespaces, LockPersonality, MemoryDenyWriteExecute, SystemCallFilter).
  * Fix: set_charge_thresholds() now validates against the firmware's own min/max
    before writing anything, instead of silently reverting an out-of-range value.
  * Fix: DaemonClient.watch_state_changed() now supports multiple subscribers, so
    the tray keeps receiving state updates after the window opens.
  * Tray: flyout submenus for thermal profile and charge mode, live checkmark
    updates via ItemsPropertiesUpdated, battery status shown in the menu.
  * Window: new primary menu (refresh, diagnostics, shortcuts, docs, report an
    issue, about).
  * First Debian/Ubuntu packaging, alongside the existing Fedora/RHEL RPM.

 -- Platform Power contributors <noreply@example.invalid>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

